{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國流行天后瑪莉亞卡里（Mariah Carey）周二晚（17日）於巴西聖保羅舉行聖誕演唱會，事後她於社交網公開當晚演出時的照片，照片中她以聖誕女郎等造型出場。</p><p>不過她於演出期間被批評動作緩慢要由舞蹈員扶住表演。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T04:23:55.745106+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T04:01:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T04:17:11.957244+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T04:17:11.957244+00:00","content_hash":"38e53221312f316d18dfd612e53a69fb5a041b04a15501c0a6ba5e8747f18e1d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}